31Z","due_on":"2025-03-03T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-03-19T09:35:35Z"},"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-01-29T08:01:27Z","updated_at":"2025-02-03T14:23:44Z","closed_at":"2025-02-03T14:23:39Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in: 4.4-dev7 and 4.4-beta1\nNot reproducible in: 4.4-dev6 and earlier builds, 4.3-stable\n\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.beta1 - Manjaro Linux #1 SMP PREEMPT_DYNAMIC Wed Dec 11 22:24:04 UTC 2024 on X11 - X11 display driver, Single-window, 1 monitor - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - GeForce GT 520M (nvidia; 390.157) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-2450M CPU @ 2.50GHz (4 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nDrag & Drop on split mode FileSystem dock (selected directory in that dock) saves the file in a directory behind the lower part of FileSystem dock if there is any.\nI think I can show it in some screenshots:\n- Scrollbar is at its lowest position so there's no part of the main dock under the 2nd part. This way the drag & drop works perfectly\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/42d7beea-ced9-4a98-a2b7-d8eb760de989)\n- 1 is the selected directory which is shown in part 3 in the screenshot. The scrollbar is not at its lowest position, so there is a part of it under part 3. So if I drag and drop a file from my system to part 3, it will be saved on the directory which is behind part 3 where the mouse position was on drop moment.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fb48c7b5-eb9e-40f2-a25b-25d232eff8d0)\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/22903028-25c0-47b4-b4d2-6d6a59324a65\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. In the editor make the FileSystem dock splitted so the selected directory is shown under the main dock\n2. Make some directories and subdirectories and open all of them (the arrow beside them are all pointing down) so the scrollbar is visible\n3. Select one of the top directories so it is opened in the lower dock\n4. Keep the scrollbar at its top position so there are some parts of the upper FileSystem dock is hidden behind the lower dock\n5. Drag and drop a file from your system on the lower dock (opened directory in step 3)\n6. The file will be saved on the directory behind this lower dock and not in the lower dock\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102146/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102146/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}